# Check-yourself question 8: schedule.in with the store task's high estimate cut from 20 to 10.
# MP8 example: a ground station backed by the team's replicated telemetry store.
# Three-point estimates in working days, written by the team before any work started.
# These are judgements of the (fictional) team, not measurements.
seed 2026
trials 20000
#    id        low likely high  after
task design      3    5    10
task threat      2    3     6   after design
task proto       4    6    12   after design
task store       5    8    10   after design
task ui          3    5     9   after proto
task integ       3    5    15   after store ui threat
task sitl        2    4    10   after integ
task gameday     1    2     4   after sitl
task defence     2    3     5   after gameday
